      },
      "xp_difficulty": 4,
      "money": 1360,
      "objectives": "Attend the memorial and accept Leza's keepsake without a combat objective.",
      "description": "Leza led us here because she believed the living could find something better. There must be room to mourn her before we speak of another march. Attend the memorial west of camp. Stay quietly for the vigil, then return to me for a totem in her memory.",
      "completion": "Keep this totem. Let it remind you that the person who dies is more than the moment of their death."
    },
